WEBVTT

01:37.560 --> 01:42.960
[Spring of The Blade]

01:43.340 --> 01:46.020
[Episode 23]

01:46.280 --> 01:48.200
You got here so quickly.

01:48.310 --> 01:50.039
It caught me off guard.

01:51.590 --> 01:52.590
Last time,

01:52.900 --> 01:54.870
weren't you whispering sweet nothings
to the fiancée

01:54.870 --> 01:56.070
of the marquis's son?

01:56.590 --> 01:57.789
Why are you

01:57.870 --> 01:59.070
all alone today?

01:59.870 --> 02:01.800
I actually feel a bit sorry for you.

02:02.310 --> 02:02.840
What?

02:03.590 --> 02:05.560
Are you now concerning yourself with

02:05.560 --> 02:06.760
my personal affairs?

02:08.560 --> 02:09.840
It was a joke.

02:10.400 --> 02:11.800
I'm just curious to see

02:12.280 --> 02:15.430
what kind of man could
capture Fourth Lady Xie's heart

02:15.960 --> 02:17.630
for secret trysts.

02:21.560 --> 02:23.760
The few ships you intercepted today are

02:23.910 --> 02:26.170
of little consequence to the Canal Gang.

02:26.750 --> 02:28.710
With how ruthlessly you operate,

02:29.079 --> 02:31.120
you'd never leave any loose ends.

02:31.680 --> 02:33.120
So your visit today is

02:33.680 --> 02:34.810
not about the ships.

02:36.360 --> 02:37.590
Take a guess.

02:38.000 --> 02:39.840
What do you think I'm here for?

02:43.710 --> 02:46.770
When Shen Zhibai was falsely accused
of major corruption in Hengtang,

02:46.770 --> 02:48.470
it shocked the court and the public.

02:48.470 --> 02:50.680
The late Emperor ordered an investigation.

02:50.680 --> 02:52.430
All officials in Hengtang
worked hand in glove

02:52.430 --> 02:53.560
to claim that he was

02:53.870 --> 02:55.800
using anti-corruption efforts as a facade

02:55.800 --> 02:57.130
to pocket public funds,

02:57.430 --> 02:59.000
chief among which was

02:59.470 --> 03:01.960
the embezzlement of
canal transport profits.

03:01.960 --> 03:03.560
If you want the truth,

03:03.750 --> 03:05.520
I'm afraid you must

03:05.910 --> 03:07.030
come to this dock.

03:09.960 --> 03:12.560
For a century, your Pei family
has monopolized

03:12.680 --> 03:15.120
the profits from
Hengtang's canal transport.

03:15.120 --> 03:17.280
If your family hadn't testified,

03:17.710 --> 03:19.520
this false accusation would never

03:19.520 --> 03:21.180
have been pinned on the Shens.

03:21.520 --> 03:22.590
As expected,

03:23.150 --> 03:25.550
you're here to hold my family accountable.

03:26.150 --> 03:28.800
Your family didn't actually
conspire with the others,

03:28.800 --> 03:30.400
so you're still redeemable.

03:30.910 --> 03:31.680
I'm here to

03:32.280 --> 03:33.590
find evidence against

03:34.420 --> 03:37.280
the person pulling the strings
behind your family.

03:38.400 --> 03:39.150
I can

03:40.560 --> 03:41.760
get you the evidence.

03:42.030 --> 03:42.870
But

03:43.470 --> 03:45.079
it comes with a price.

03:53.310 --> 03:54.440
Give yourself to me.

03:54.800 --> 03:55.660
What do you say?

03:58.030 --> 03:59.120
The largest

03:59.300 --> 04:00.600
Eastern Pearl market in Hengtang

04:00.600 --> 04:01.870
is right ahead.

04:01.870 --> 04:03.080
We'll see

04:03.100 --> 04:04.500
its shopfront sign soon.

04:16.089 --> 04:20.290
♪ I counted every moment ♪

04:20.399 --> 04:24.870
♪ Memories take root;
the annual rings grow ♪

04:25.000 --> 04:29.200
♪ Who bore the parting wind ♪

04:25.400 --> 04:26.660
I asked you a question.

04:29.300 --> 04:33.530
♪ And wove it gently into the warmth
of the past? ♪

04:31.720 --> 04:32.320
Qingyuan?

04:33.830 --> 04:38.070
♪ I honor every scar upon your hand ♪

04:35.510 --> 04:36.840
Eastern Pearls, right?

04:38.370 --> 04:42.700
♪ Through endless nights,
a lone soul wanders this mortal world ♪

04:39.950 --> 04:40.950
There's a shop here.

04:40.950 --> 04:41.680
This shop...

04:42.800 --> 04:49.000
♪ Turning back, we embrace—
one fleeting moment of love and hate ♪

04:44.510 --> 04:46.310
Hello. What are you looking for?

04:47.070 --> 04:47.600
Could you

04:48.040 --> 04:48.630
show me

04:48.630 --> 04:49.920
your best Eastern Pearls?

04:49.100 --> 04:52.800
♪ As flowers fall beneath the dusk ♪

04:50.360 --> 04:51.070
They're all here.

04:51.070 --> 04:52.900
Or shall I help you pick some more?

04:52.900 --> 04:58.330
♪ Sorrowed by many a farewell,
comforted by sweet memories ♪

04:53.040 --> 04:54.680
I can't just give you

04:54.920 --> 04:55.830
the evidence

04:55.830 --> 04:57.120
you want.

04:58.560 --> 05:00.120
You've been alone for a long time,

04:58.560 --> 05:02.610
♪ One life, one love,
one heart devoted to you ♪

05:00.920 --> 05:02.160
so you aren't aware that

05:02.160 --> 05:03.800
in Hengtang, even in the capital,

05:02.750 --> 05:07.010
♪ In the depths of darkness,
you are the stars ♪

05:04.160 --> 05:07.110
families rely on marriage alliances
to strengthen their power.

05:07.110 --> 05:11.030
♪ Trample the abyss, together we run ♪

05:07.430 --> 05:09.230
I'll help you find the evidence,

05:09.750 --> 05:11.270
and you'll give yourself to me.

05:11.190 --> 05:16.080
♪ May we grow deep in years together,
sharing one life and one pillow ♪

05:11.630 --> 05:13.240
It's a reasonable deal.

05:13.240 --> 05:15.160
The Eastern Pearl hairpin
from before broke.

05:15.160 --> 05:17.000
I've been wanting to
give you a better one,

05:16.220 --> 05:20.490
♪ Rise and fall as one,
whether we're united or apart ♪

05:18.950 --> 05:20.160
but I could never find the time,

05:20.160 --> 05:20.950
until today.

05:20.650 --> 05:24.760
♪ Hand in hand,
we brave all the storms of life ♪

05:21.390 --> 05:23.450
But I don't think their stuff is good.

05:23.680 --> 05:24.310
Qingyuan,

05:24.680 --> 05:25.360
actually,

05:24.900 --> 05:32.000
♪ Never to part, forevermore ♪

05:25.630 --> 05:27.480
you don't have to rush
to fall in love with me.

05:27.480 --> 05:28.680
After we get married,

05:28.870 --> 05:30.470
we'll have 5 years, 10 years,

05:30.870 --> 05:32.000
a lifetime together.

05:32.000 --> 05:33.159
As long as you're willing,

05:33.159 --> 05:34.159
I'll wait for you.

05:36.360 --> 05:38.510
You want to use the case of Shen Zhibai

05:38.630 --> 05:41.720
to implicate Commissioner Hu
in the old case of Hengtang.

05:41.720 --> 05:43.159
It is a brilliant move.

05:43.360 --> 05:45.290
This elegant one suits you better.

05:45.750 --> 05:47.830
But I was one step ahead of you.

05:48.159 --> 05:49.750
I've already killed off

05:50.040 --> 05:52.240
all the spineless cowards you could use

05:52.480 --> 05:53.750
as a pawn.

05:57.830 --> 06:00.390
Right now, only I can help you.

06:05.510 --> 06:06.110
Qingyuan,

06:06.800 --> 06:07.400
do you like

06:07.480 --> 06:08.360
this or this?

06:11.070 --> 06:11.930
Either's fine.

06:13.000 --> 06:13.920
Either?

06:18.100 --> 06:20.360
Mom said if you can't choose,
the options are all bad.

06:20.360 --> 06:21.120
This won't do.

06:21.120 --> 06:23.520
Let's go to the biggest
Eastern Pearl shop!

06:43.159 --> 06:44.750
You're truly a rare breed,

06:45.330 --> 06:48.390
unfazed even by the possibility of
the extermination of your clan.

06:48.390 --> 06:49.510
Someone like you

06:49.950 --> 06:51.150
is a worthy opponent.

06:51.510 --> 06:53.040
But I forgot to tell you that

06:53.720 --> 06:56.120
whoever stands in the way
of me finding the truth

06:56.120 --> 06:57.380
will only have one end,

06:58.390 --> 06:59.360
which is death.

07:03.190 --> 07:04.560
You must be joking.

07:05.120 --> 07:06.560
In a place like Hengtang,

07:07.000 --> 07:08.830
even an imperial edict

07:08.830 --> 07:10.160
carries little weight.

07:10.720 --> 07:11.830
At best,

07:12.160 --> 07:13.430
incoming officials

07:13.430 --> 07:15.070
end up like Wei Changyan.

07:16.430 --> 07:17.360
At worst, they

07:18.000 --> 07:19.360
become content with playing dumb

07:19.360 --> 07:20.420
like Prefect Qian.

07:21.000 --> 07:22.270
Only Shen Zhibai would be

07:22.270 --> 07:24.190
so ignorant, reckless, and delusional

07:24.190 --> 07:26.870
as to think he could
shake the order of Hengtang.

07:29.950 --> 07:31.510
Hengtang has its own rules.

07:32.150 --> 07:33.390
Break the rules,

07:33.390 --> 07:34.650
and the price is death.

07:35.870 --> 07:37.730
That was the case for Shen Zhibai.

07:37.830 --> 07:38.680
And it will be

07:39.430 --> 07:40.480
the case for you.

07:43.950 --> 07:45.310
Well said.

07:46.159 --> 07:48.220
But what is hidden must come to light.

07:48.240 --> 07:50.070
Who knows what the rules will look like

07:50.070 --> 07:51.159
down the road?

07:53.680 --> 07:54.750
In the past,

07:55.000 --> 07:57.159
I only found Fourth Lady fascinating.

07:58.430 --> 07:59.560
But now it seems

08:00.720 --> 08:02.450
you're even more interesting.

08:07.560 --> 08:09.680
This matter is too shocking, scandalous,

08:09.680 --> 08:10.750
and unheard of.

08:11.160 --> 08:12.820
Forgive me, but I can't agree.

08:16.040 --> 08:18.160
We're both mothers.

08:18.600 --> 08:19.560
I don't believe

08:20.600 --> 08:21.600
you don't know

08:21.920 --> 08:24.480
who is genuinely good to your child.

08:25.510 --> 08:27.270
Qingyuan is great

08:27.830 --> 08:29.750
and Chunzhi adores her.

08:30.680 --> 08:31.560
However,

08:32.630 --> 08:34.000
she is unusually

08:34.150 --> 08:35.510
close to Shen Run.

08:36.200 --> 08:38.530
If she marries into the marquis's family,

08:39.200 --> 08:40.929
I'm afraid Chunzhi will have to

08:41.720 --> 08:43.650
endure a lifetime of humiliation.

08:50.120 --> 08:51.630
Qingru is different.

08:52.360 --> 08:53.420
They've been close

08:53.510 --> 08:54.720
since they were kids.

08:55.440 --> 08:57.900
She's the one who
truly cares about Chunzhi.

09:02.720 --> 09:04.150
If a principal wife

09:04.840 --> 09:06.960
is devoted to the patriarch,

09:07.510 --> 09:09.150
the family will

09:09.670 --> 09:11.270
surely prosper.

09:20.360 --> 09:22.960
My elder brother
happens to be visiting too.

09:24.750 --> 09:27.910
He can attend his niece's wedding.

09:28.240 --> 09:29.840
Wouldn't that be wonderful?

09:32.630 --> 09:34.360
Commissioner Hu is coming too?

09:47.440 --> 09:51.080
There's still time before
the marriage deed is sent

09:51.910 --> 09:53.390
to the Ministry of Rites.

09:56.670 --> 09:58.000
It's a joyous occasion.

10:01.240 --> 10:02.370
His Majesty agreed?

10:02.910 --> 10:05.370
His Majesty is already
aware of your meeting

10:05.600 --> 10:07.060
with Yongjia County Lady.

10:07.600 --> 10:09.460
He is willing to give you a chance.

10:11.790 --> 10:13.510
You're truly resourceful.

10:14.150 --> 10:15.670
It's only been a few days,

10:16.750 --> 10:18.480
and you've reported my every move

10:18.480 --> 10:20.030
to His Majesty.

10:20.440 --> 10:23.040
Your alliance with Xie Shu
to bring down Hu Xing

10:23.080 --> 10:24.880
is what His Majesty wants to see,

10:25.600 --> 10:27.270
so naturally, he hopes you will maintain

10:27.270 --> 10:29.000
close ties with the Xie family.

10:29.240 --> 10:30.870
I was ordered to

10:31.200 --> 10:32.130
relay to you that

10:32.550 --> 10:34.150
he's agreed to your request.

10:34.480 --> 10:35.840
But I'm sure you know

10:36.200 --> 10:37.930
what conditions are involved.

10:38.670 --> 10:40.630
Whether you accept this favor

10:41.000 --> 10:42.840
is entirely up to you.

11:12.630 --> 11:13.480
My dear,

11:14.120 --> 11:16.200
isn't my osmanthus wine good?

11:17.840 --> 11:20.360
It's my favorite too.

11:24.440 --> 11:25.910
Once you're married,

11:26.720 --> 11:27.840
you won't really

11:28.030 --> 11:30.440
have a chance to visit anymore.

11:31.550 --> 11:32.270
My baby.

11:32.630 --> 11:33.240
Come on.

11:34.840 --> 11:36.440
I'll drink a little with you.

11:44.960 --> 11:46.200
Don't drink too much.

11:51.480 --> 11:52.480
Silly child.

11:52.550 --> 11:54.550
That's not how you drink wine.

11:56.670 --> 11:57.270
Slow down.

11:59.870 --> 12:00.600
Granny.

12:03.030 --> 12:04.200
I'm just happy.

12:04.960 --> 12:06.690
I'm getting married tomorrow.

12:07.000 --> 12:08.480
Aren't you happy for me?

12:12.670 --> 12:15.000
Knowing that you'll have good days ahead,

12:15.390 --> 12:16.870
how could I not be?

12:20.630 --> 12:22.200
Don't think I don't know

12:22.200 --> 12:24.440
what you're really thinking.

12:24.960 --> 12:27.360
You're marrying into the marquis's family

12:27.600 --> 12:29.440
not for the heir

12:29.960 --> 12:31.200
but for your mother.

12:36.030 --> 12:37.000
You are

12:37.360 --> 12:38.890
getting married tomorrow.

12:39.480 --> 12:41.210
I shouldn't say anything more.

12:47.320 --> 12:48.270
It's just...

12:48.790 --> 12:49.960
It's just...

12:51.550 --> 12:52.910
I know full well that

12:53.240 --> 12:54.720
this is the price I have to pay

12:54.720 --> 12:55.840
to seek justice,

12:56.840 --> 12:58.030
but this price...

12:59.840 --> 13:01.320
is really too heavy.

13:03.120 --> 13:03.790
Granny,

13:05.480 --> 13:07.030
did I choose the wrong path

13:07.720 --> 13:09.180
and make the wrong choice?

13:11.030 --> 13:12.320
Silly girl.

13:13.320 --> 13:14.480
It's okay.

13:16.030 --> 13:17.550
Most people

13:18.270 --> 13:20.480
start out not knowing what

13:20.600 --> 13:22.080
they really want.

13:22.630 --> 13:24.870
Later, as they move along,

13:25.320 --> 13:26.510
they fall and cry,

13:26.750 --> 13:27.750
and think they

13:28.270 --> 13:29.720
took the wrong path.

13:30.510 --> 13:31.630
In the end,

13:32.110 --> 13:33.240
looking back,

13:33.960 --> 13:35.270
they realize

13:36.270 --> 13:37.840
everything was arranged

13:37.840 --> 13:39.720
by heaven long ago,

13:40.630 --> 13:44.080
so we can get what we wish for.

13:54.440 --> 13:55.600
It's okay.

13:56.120 --> 13:57.360
But I can't let go.

14:00.320 --> 14:01.240
Granny,

14:03.360 --> 14:04.750
I really can't let go.

14:07.960 --> 14:09.080
It's okay.

14:09.440 --> 14:10.630
I know.

14:11.750 --> 14:13.120
I know.

14:51.670 --> 14:52.600
Why are you here?

14:54.840 --> 14:55.670
Did you drink?

15:03.200 --> 15:04.930
Why didn't I know you can drink?

15:07.670 --> 15:08.600
Get out of my way.

15:12.270 --> 15:12.750
What?

15:13.960 --> 15:16.290
Did you have to
drink to drown your sorrows

15:16.320 --> 15:18.380
when it's your wedding day tomorrow?

15:25.910 --> 15:26.910
I'm happy.

15:29.960 --> 15:30.910
You're lying.

15:31.750 --> 15:32.790
I'm not lying.

15:33.720 --> 15:34.790
I'm beyond happy.

15:36.750 --> 15:37.880
And what about that?

15:41.050 --> 15:47.580
♪ You, tender yet sharp,
with thorns by your side ♪

15:47.670 --> 15:54.290
♪ Like a dim yet blazing candle ♪

15:54.390 --> 15:58.250
♪ The wind and rain sigh,
the road stretches far ♪

15:56.910 --> 15:57.840
What do you want?

15:58.300 --> 16:01.500
♪ Blossoms drift with streams,
affections softly stir ♪

16:01.600 --> 16:08.110
♪ Half real, half illusion;
one cup of spring awakes me ♪

16:02.200 --> 16:03.870
How could you say you're happy

16:05.240 --> 16:06.970
to marry another man to my face?

16:09.060 --> 16:16.000
♪ Burned and released,
held by fate's hand ♪

16:11.440 --> 16:12.700
Is it wrong to be happy?

16:16.400 --> 16:23.000
♪ Greet the soft, mild evening breeze
and homebound sail to land ♪

16:17.360 --> 16:19.390
When you were with the county lady,

16:20.670 --> 16:22.270
you seemed pretty happy too.

16:23.200 --> 16:26.820
♪ Slim moonbeams
weave tangled dreams all night ♪

16:25.360 --> 16:26.790
What exactly do you want?

16:27.150 --> 16:30.500
♪ The homeward boat glides slowly
through dark twilight ♪

16:28.750 --> 16:30.270
I want to marry you.

16:30.720 --> 16:37.120
♪ I walk and gaze; one cup of spring
fades to lingering cheer ♪

17:04.800 --> 17:11.490
♪ You, tender yet sharp,
with thorns by your side ♪

17:11.569 --> 17:18.490
♪ Like a dim yet blazing candle ♪

17:18.609 --> 17:22.420
♪ The wind and rain sigh,
the road stretches far ♪

17:22.500 --> 17:26.000
♪ Blossoms drift with streams,
affections softly stir ♪

17:26.200 --> 17:33.390
♪ Half real, half illusion;
one cup of spring awakes me ♪

17:33.420 --> 17:40.230
♪ Burned and released,
held by fate's hand ♪

17:40.630 --> 17:47.400
♪ Greet the soft, mild evening breeze
and homebound sail to land ♪

17:47.450 --> 17:51.280
♪ Slim moonbeams
weave tangled dreams all night ♪

17:51.380 --> 17:54.950
♪ The homeward boat glides slowly
through dark twilight ♪

17:55.000 --> 18:01.260
♪ I walk and gaze; one cup of spring
fades to lingering cheer ♪

18:14.550 --> 18:15.310
My Lady,

18:15.800 --> 18:17.800
have you really thought it through?

18:18.070 --> 18:19.670
If you've changed your mind,

18:19.720 --> 18:20.880
we can help you.

18:23.510 --> 18:24.770
Are you really ready to

18:25.880 --> 18:27.010
throw away your life

18:27.400 --> 18:28.440
for revenge?

18:29.400 --> 18:30.590
You clearly like Shen Run—

18:30.590 --> 18:31.590
My mind is made up.

18:34.160 --> 18:35.310
Stop dissuading me.

18:38.750 --> 18:46.100
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

18:47.640 --> 18:53.330
♪ Waiting for a dream to sink into
the depths of the night ♪

18:53.390 --> 18:59.460
♪ Waiting for a rain to wash away
the heat burning in my eyes ♪

18:59.530 --> 19:05.200
♪ Waiting for a few flowers to bloom,
then quietly fall ♪

19:05.220 --> 19:11.330
♪ Only then do I understand right
from what's wrong and bitter ♪

19:11.360 --> 19:17.520
♪ Through the courtyard, pear blossoms
flutter like snowflakes in a song ♪

19:17.580 --> 19:23.670
♪ Singing the silence of love and hate ♪

19:23.700 --> 19:30.090
♪  Which moment is hypothetical,
and which is a real choice? ♪

19:30.150 --> 19:36.070
♪ Who is drifting aimlessly in the wind? ♪

19:31.880 --> 19:33.540
I'll give you one last chance.

19:36.160 --> 19:42.290
♪ I wonder why joy is always
so scarce in this world ♪

19:36.270 --> 19:37.030
Wait for me.

19:38.110 --> 19:39.770
I'll make your wish come true.

19:41.510 --> 19:42.590
How long do I have to wait?

19:42.320 --> 19:48.260
♪ I wonder,
is that tear a loss or a gain? ♪

19:44.680 --> 19:46.140
I won't make you wait long.

19:47.590 --> 19:48.550
I can't wait.

19:48.310 --> 19:54.530
♪ Two souls trapped on the opposite banks
of life and death ♪

19:49.680 --> 19:50.680
It's now or never.

19:52.240 --> 19:53.640
This is the last chance.

19:54.550 --> 20:00.550
♪ May you and I overcome karma's bonds ♪

20:20.920 --> 20:22.780
The auspicious hour has arrived!

20:26.270 --> 20:27.350
Lift the sedan.

20:28.830 --> 20:34.660
♪ Waiting for a dream to sink into
the depths of the night ♪

20:28.960 --> 20:30.240
Hit the road!

20:34.690 --> 20:40.680
♪ Waiting for a rain to wash away
the heat burning in my eyes ♪

20:40.830 --> 20:46.180
♪ Waiting for a few flowers to bloom,
then quietly fall ♪

20:46.260 --> 20:51.080
♪ Only then do I understand right
from what's wrong and bitter ♪

20:49.270 --> 20:51.240
My biggest dream in life

20:51.750 --> 20:53.720
is to become Chunzhi's wife.

20:54.960 --> 20:57.000
But now he's marrying someone else!

20:57.000 --> 20:59.830
What's the point of living?

21:01.510 --> 21:02.400
Mother,

21:02.720 --> 21:05.510
I don't want to live anymore!

21:07.350 --> 21:08.880
Just have a good cry.

21:09.750 --> 21:11.270
I told you that

21:11.960 --> 21:13.830
I can protect you for a while,

21:15.070 --> 21:16.870
but I can't protect you forever.

21:17.680 --> 21:18.880
You'll have to

21:20.030 --> 21:21.920
shoulder many things on your own.

21:23.000 --> 21:23.930
There is no rush.

21:24.590 --> 21:25.510
Well,

21:26.680 --> 21:28.790
the wheel of fortune is still turning.

21:28.790 --> 21:31.400
I don't want to hear
these abstract lectures.

21:31.830 --> 21:34.200
He's about to marry someone else.

21:34.200 --> 21:36.000
What else can I do?

21:39.550 --> 21:40.640
They have yet to

21:41.920 --> 21:43.310
tie the knot, have they?

22:00.400 --> 22:01.070
Bearers?

22:51.750 --> 22:52.950
Yesterday, I dreamed

22:53.880 --> 22:55.940
of the first time I met you, Qingyuan,

22:56.440 --> 22:58.030
and today you're my bride.

22:59.720 --> 23:01.110
Am I still dreaming?

23:04.550 --> 23:05.440
Who sent you?

23:06.200 --> 23:07.590
Do you know who I am?

23:07.830 --> 23:08.830
If you hurt me,

23:08.960 --> 23:11.090
none of you will leave Hengtang alive!

23:16.790 --> 23:18.050
How much were you paid?

23:18.550 --> 23:19.640
I'll pay double.

23:20.680 --> 23:21.240
Miss,

23:21.550 --> 23:23.280
you've already seen our faces.

23:23.750 --> 23:25.000
No amount of money

23:25.160 --> 23:26.510
can save your life.

23:27.000 --> 23:29.200
Just accept your fate and be on your way.

23:55.680 --> 23:56.350
Shen...

23:56.510 --> 23:57.310
Shen Che?

24:30.000 --> 24:31.200
Thanks for saving me.

24:32.110 --> 24:32.790
Did...

24:33.270 --> 24:34.720
Shen Run send you?

24:51.440 --> 24:53.100
You're marrying someone else

24:53.480 --> 24:55.680
and still expect my brother to save you?

24:59.550 --> 25:01.110
I didn't come to save you.

25:01.720 --> 25:03.250
I came because I was worried

25:03.480 --> 25:05.830
you'd forget the way
to the marquis's residence

25:05.830 --> 25:07.490
and miss the auspicious hour.

25:08.550 --> 25:11.080
You want to make sure
my wedding goes smoothly

25:11.110 --> 25:13.170
so Shen Run can move on from me, right?

25:14.350 --> 25:15.150
That's right.

25:16.000 --> 25:16.830
If I kill you,

25:17.300 --> 25:19.830
he'll just pine for you
for the rest of his life.

25:19.830 --> 25:22.090
Only when you become someone else's wife

25:22.160 --> 25:23.360
will he truly move on.

25:24.200 --> 25:25.920
He made his choice long ago,

25:26.400 --> 25:28.000
and I have my own path to walk.

25:28.100 --> 25:29.110
Our paths are different,

25:29.110 --> 25:30.240
so we must part ways.

25:30.480 --> 25:31.940
You don't need to force me.

25:31.960 --> 25:32.720
I was on my way

25:33.240 --> 25:34.500
to the wedding anyway.

25:47.680 --> 25:50.110
The bride has arrived!

26:25.680 --> 26:27.340
Walk upon the carpet squares!

26:27.720 --> 26:29.680
Verdant grass drenched in rain and dew!

26:29.680 --> 26:31.600
May every step bring blessings,

26:32.000 --> 26:33.750
and a noble path

26:33.920 --> 26:36.000
lead to endless grace!

27:07.440 --> 27:08.920
Step over the saddle!

27:18.680 --> 27:20.160
May you enjoy

27:20.440 --> 27:22.200
peace year after year,

27:22.640 --> 27:24.400
and grow old together

27:24.640 --> 27:27.000
in lifelong health and peace!

27:55.960 --> 27:57.680
Scatter the five grains!

27:58.920 --> 28:00.920
May the five grains fill your granaries,

28:00.920 --> 28:03.050
and blessings overflow the universe!

28:03.680 --> 28:05.410
May your family be auspicious,

28:05.510 --> 28:08.270
and your lineage flourish for generations!

28:33.880 --> 28:35.210
Bow to heaven and earth!

28:39.110 --> 28:41.000
First bow to heaven and earth!

28:42.510 --> 28:43.480
Bow!

28:59.350 --> 29:03.000
They have yet to tie the knot, have they?

29:05.400 --> 29:06.640
Bring it here.

29:18.640 --> 29:19.270
This...

29:20.640 --> 29:21.510
This is...

29:27.720 --> 29:28.920
I told you

29:29.510 --> 29:30.830
your marriage is

29:32.750 --> 29:34.590
more important than my life.

29:50.790 --> 29:52.960
Second bow to the parents!

29:56.790 --> 29:57.750
Bow!

30:04.640 --> 30:06.680
Husband and wife, bow to each other!

30:15.270 --> 30:16.270
Bow!

30:33.750 --> 30:35.880
The ceremony is complete!

30:36.590 --> 30:38.640
Bravo! Bravo!

30:38.640 --> 30:39.160
Congratulations!

30:39.160 --> 30:41.720
-Bravo!
-Congratulations!

30:42.120 --> 30:44.120
Have a long and happy life together!

31:00.790 --> 31:01.720
Qingyuan.

31:03.310 --> 31:04.200
From now on,

31:05.160 --> 31:06.270
you are my wife.

31:09.310 --> 31:10.110
Wait a minute!

31:38.270 --> 31:39.590
Why did you start

31:39.590 --> 31:40.650
without the bride?

31:41.790 --> 31:42.750
Qingyuan?

31:42.820 --> 31:44.280
Who's under the veil then?

32:29.590 --> 32:30.400
An impostor?

33:00.440 --> 33:01.110
My son,

33:02.000 --> 33:02.590
I...

33:14.160 --> 33:15.510
I'll go check on Qingru.

33:34.510 --> 33:35.350
Qingyuan!

34:17.190 --> 34:18.760
I apologize, Young Master Li.

34:18.760 --> 34:20.219
Courtesy of someone else,

34:20.280 --> 34:21.440
I'm a little late.

34:25.070 --> 34:25.800
Come with me!

34:26.670 --> 34:27.400
Father,

34:28.070 --> 34:29.330
from beginning to end,

34:29.360 --> 34:30.510
the one I want to marry

34:30.510 --> 34:31.710
is Xie Qingyuan.

34:31.800 --> 34:32.670
She's here now.

34:32.960 --> 34:34.620
Let's redo the wedding rites!

34:40.230 --> 34:41.360
You're out of line!

34:41.840 --> 34:44.920
Since you've performed the wedding rites

34:44.920 --> 34:46.670
with Second Lady Xie,

34:46.840 --> 34:48.250
the two of you are

34:48.440 --> 34:49.900
husband and wife for life!

34:50.230 --> 34:51.550
Everyone here's a witness.

34:51.550 --> 34:53.010
This isn't playing house!

35:00.110 --> 35:01.150
Lord Xie,

35:01.670 --> 35:05.070
we agreed on a marriage with Fourth Lady.

35:05.070 --> 35:06.840
Why did it become Second Lady?

35:09.400 --> 35:12.480
Did we agree on Fourth Lady?

35:16.000 --> 35:17.510
Cut the crap!

35:17.920 --> 35:19.120
Second Lady is the one

35:19.630 --> 35:22.190
Madam Li and I have been
talking about all along.

35:22.190 --> 35:24.420
Weren't you aware, Your Lordship?

35:24.510 --> 35:25.920
No, I wasn't!

35:31.320 --> 35:34.000
When my elder brother arrives,

35:34.230 --> 35:35.690
Madam Li and I will give you

35:35.840 --> 35:38.110
a proper explanation, Your Lordship.

35:49.440 --> 35:52.550
When will Commissioner Hu arrive?

35:54.280 --> 35:55.360
My brother said

35:55.480 --> 35:58.080
he couldn't miss
his niece's wedding banquet.

36:02.480 --> 36:04.360
Then how should we handle

36:04.360 --> 36:05.550
this situation?

36:06.000 --> 36:07.460
Calm down, Your Lordship.

36:07.840 --> 36:08.510
Take a seat.

36:12.360 --> 36:13.030
Li.

36:13.280 --> 36:14.140
Don't touch me!

36:19.710 --> 36:20.910
The marquis is right.

36:21.510 --> 36:22.910
The ceremony is complete

36:23.150 --> 36:24.350
and cannot be undone.

36:24.360 --> 36:26.160
I don't care about the ceremony!

36:26.230 --> 36:27.960
I've sworn to marry Xie Qingyuan.

36:27.960 --> 36:30.480
I'll give up my position
as Marquis of Danyang's heir

36:30.480 --> 36:31.510
before I yield.

36:35.070 --> 36:36.000
Young Master Li.

36:42.590 --> 36:43.450
Your Lordship,

36:44.000 --> 36:45.710
since things have come to this,

36:45.710 --> 36:47.560
I have a suggestion which

36:47.630 --> 36:50.000
both fulfills Young Master Li's wish

36:50.360 --> 36:52.630
and brings our two families closer.

36:54.440 --> 36:56.360
Why don't Young Master Li

36:56.760 --> 36:59.320
take Qingyuan as a concubine today?

37:00.230 --> 37:02.510
Wouldn't that be a double blessing?

37:09.070 --> 37:09.630
No!

37:10.280 --> 37:11.320
My pledge to marry

37:11.760 --> 37:12.920
Qingyuan as my wife

37:13.630 --> 37:14.490
is set in stone.

37:16.400 --> 37:17.400
Young Master Li,

37:17.710 --> 37:20.710
you should give it some serious thought.

37:22.110 --> 37:24.630
Qingyuan crashed the wedding hall

37:24.960 --> 37:26.440
in her wedding dress

37:26.800 --> 37:29.400
after you completed the ceremony.

37:29.670 --> 37:32.190
This act brings disgrace to our family

37:32.360 --> 37:34.160
and violates moral principles.

37:34.320 --> 37:36.320
If you don't take her as a concubine,

37:36.800 --> 37:37.960
the Xie household

37:38.360 --> 37:39.840
cannot keep her either.

37:40.110 --> 37:41.360
We'll have no choice

37:41.880 --> 37:44.630
but to send her to a nunnery
outside the city

37:45.070 --> 37:46.440
to become a nun.

37:46.880 --> 37:50.550
For the rest of her life,
she'll never be able to

37:50.630 --> 37:52.430
step out of those nunnery gates.

38:00.670 --> 38:03.670
But if you take her as a concubine,

38:03.960 --> 38:06.590
wouldn't you be able to protect her?

38:07.440 --> 38:10.920
Can you really bear to see her end up

38:11.320 --> 38:13.070
in such a place of hardship?

38:28.110 --> 38:29.110
Your Lordship,

38:29.710 --> 38:31.920
this matter cannot be delayed.

38:32.320 --> 38:34.150
If word gets out,

38:34.360 --> 38:36.760
it'll be disastrous for both our families.

38:37.190 --> 38:38.400
By then,

38:38.400 --> 38:40.230
we won't be able to help her

38:40.320 --> 38:41.760
even if we want to.

38:42.550 --> 38:43.410
Your Lordship,

38:44.030 --> 38:45.030
what do you think?

38:56.030 --> 38:57.030
My child,

38:57.630 --> 38:59.480
do you really have the heart

38:59.670 --> 39:02.550
to drive Qingyuan into a corner?

39:06.030 --> 39:08.480
If you truly care for her, you should know

39:08.840 --> 39:10.440
which is more important:

39:10.880 --> 39:12.110
the title of wife

39:12.760 --> 39:14.190
or the rest of her life.

39:24.030 --> 39:25.000
Qingyuan.

39:29.280 --> 39:30.190
I...

39:31.800 --> 39:33.460
I don't want to see you suffer.

39:34.030 --> 39:34.840
But I...

39:35.760 --> 39:36.400
But I...

39:39.360 --> 39:40.820
That day at the snack shop,

39:41.150 --> 39:42.750
you swore to heaven that

39:43.150 --> 39:44.880
you'd marry only me as your wife

39:45.360 --> 39:46.840
and never take a concubine.

39:46.840 --> 39:47.920
I thought you were

39:48.550 --> 39:49.950
different from other men

39:50.070 --> 39:51.880
who take multiple wives and concubines,

39:51.880 --> 39:54.320
causing unrest in the household.

39:58.710 --> 39:59.230
No,

39:59.510 --> 40:00.000
I...

40:00.000 --> 40:00.930
Young Master Li,

40:01.550 --> 40:02.320
I know

40:02.590 --> 40:03.980
you didn't mean to

40:04.020 --> 40:05.280
break your promise.

40:05.880 --> 40:07.800
But since you're already married,

40:07.800 --> 40:09.460
it means we're not meant to be.

40:09.770 --> 40:12.430
You don't need to insist on
marrying me anymore.

40:26.440 --> 40:28.000
Enough, Qingyuan.

40:28.960 --> 40:31.380
Stop being unreasonable, okay?

40:31.710 --> 40:33.230
Marriage is decided by the parents

40:33.230 --> 40:34.670
and arranged by a matchmaker.

40:34.670 --> 40:36.930
There's no room for private betrothals!

40:37.440 --> 40:40.530
Young Master Li's feelings for you
are sincere.

40:40.840 --> 40:42.370
Instead of being grateful,

40:42.440 --> 40:44.550
why are you being so aggressive?

40:45.510 --> 40:46.280
That day,

40:46.630 --> 40:49.740
I only agreed to the marriage
because the heir swore

40:49.800 --> 40:51.360
to marry me as his wife.

40:51.880 --> 40:52.670
Now,

40:53.000 --> 40:54.200
I've kept my promise,

40:54.440 --> 40:56.090
but he married someone else.

40:56.110 --> 40:58.190
I just want to cancel the engagement.

40:58.440 --> 41:00.100
How's that being aggressive?

41:08.400 --> 41:09.280
Fine.

41:12.070 --> 41:14.170
My Lord and Your Lordship,

41:14.440 --> 41:15.900
please make the decision.

41:24.400 --> 41:25.070
Li.

41:36.510 --> 41:37.310
It's decided.

41:37.840 --> 41:39.630
After a discussion with Li,

41:39.840 --> 41:41.000
we'll do

41:41.590 --> 41:42.670
as you proposed.

41:43.840 --> 41:45.920
What a brilliant idea,

41:45.920 --> 41:46.800
My Lady.

41:47.440 --> 41:51.510
Good things come in pairs, don't they?

41:51.760 --> 41:54.610
Let auspiciousness beget auspiciousness.

41:54.880 --> 41:55.880
As the saying goes,

41:55.880 --> 41:57.320
there's no time like the present.

41:57.320 --> 41:59.510
This is a foolproof plan.

42:00.670 --> 42:01.510
Qingyuan,

42:01.760 --> 42:02.880
do as we say.

42:03.110 --> 42:05.960
If you don't marry into
the marquis's family today,

42:05.960 --> 42:07.190
in the future,

42:07.360 --> 42:09.410
who would dare to marry you?

42:11.840 --> 42:12.360
Yes.

42:17.000 --> 42:18.800
So what if no one marries me?

42:19.190 --> 42:20.510
I can live well

42:20.920 --> 42:22.550
on my own.

42:26.440 --> 42:29.970
I'd rather spend the remainder of my life
in monastic seclusion

42:30.110 --> 42:31.670
than submit to being a concubine!
